WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.510
...crazy about you!

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.020
I don't care if you're still
in love with Toji, Momo-chan.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:47.190
I just want to be by your side.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:55.170
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.600
when we planted a peach pit?

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:01.540
This is a quince flower.
Peach blossoms don't look like this.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:05.870
No way! The old man next door
said this was a peach!

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.210
I knew it.

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.410
You're so easy.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:19.220
Oh I just remembered. There is
a peach blossom here. Right here.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:22.890
Do you know, Momo-chan, what the
meaning of "'peach blossom"' is?

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:25.730
I am your captive...

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.290
I am your...

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.970
...captive.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:44.910
"'Shock! An Ex-Girlfriend Barges In!?"'

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.910
Look at those two! Together again!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.250
I wonder if they're dating?

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:03.520
Last time, Adachi said
they were just friends.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.190
But someone saw them kissing.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.680
No way!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.530
Break up with Kairi.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:22.210
Why do I have to listen to you?

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:28.210
Everyone's been saying that you
still carry a torch for Tojigamori.

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:31.210
Aren't you seeing Kairi on the rebound?

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:34.880
Anyone will do as long
as they're cute, right?!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:39.220
Swear that you'll never
talk to Kairi again!

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.560
Poor thing...

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:44.560
That's why Okayasu would never pick you.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:46.550
How dare you?!

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.570
Who's worse?!

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:54.240
When you don't even love Kairi!

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.300
Shut up!

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:03.180
Do you think I'd kiss someone
I didn't like?! Of course, I love him!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.310
W- why you-!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.190
That's enough.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.130
Kairi!

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:23.530
What a way to act... just because
you're not getting the attention you want.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.540
But Kairi, we...

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:29.770
Don't make me any more
disgusted with you.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:42.220
Girls always go after the girl
when there's jealousy and love.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:46.020
I was wondering when
they'd start something.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.890
Okayasu...

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.830
Momo-chan! You're all right now...

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.170
It feels so good!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.170
Why don't you come here, too, Okayasu?

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.840
No thanks.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:13.180
No way! You can't even stick your feet
in the water? Are you that afraid of water?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.180
Yeah...

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:19.520
No kidding... Well, you did
almost drown in the ocean.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:24.530
I understand it was a real close call.
I don't remember anything, though.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:28.870
It sure was. There was
such a panic that time.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:33.540
Are you sure it wasn't you
who did the CPR, Momo-chan?

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:34.870
I already told you, no.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:38.880
But how'd you find out that I was the one
who pulled you out of the ocean?

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.910
Right after I started school here,
Momo-chan,

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:44.880
I heard your name mentioned,
and it rang a bell.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:50.220
I thought the girl who saved me
had a name like that.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:53.220
Then why didn't you approach me?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:58.230
Because even though I may not look it,
I'm actually very shy.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.830
Liar!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.500
But isn't it strange?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.300
If you didn't almost drown that time,
Okayasu,

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.840
we wouldn't be sitting here like this.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.510
That's for sure.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.510
Say, before your fear of water,
were you a good swimmer?

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.510
Not at all.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:20.520
Then why were you swimming out so far?

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.250
The waves were so high that day. It was
right after the typhoon passed through.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:34.160
I thought if I swam far enough, I'd die.

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:52.210
Just kidding! Did you believe me? Did you?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.880
I was just joking!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:58.220
Joking? That was... too serious for a joke.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:01.820
l feel like l've seen
another side of Okayasu...

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:06.500
That's right, l'm always
talking about myself.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:10.170
l don't know anything about Okayasu.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.000
Shall we go?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.180
Thank goodness! It still works!

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:26.520
It's torn. Why don't you buy another one?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.850
Nah... I'm a little
short on cash right now.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:33.250
Don't worry, I'll just tape it up
and it'll be fine.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.860
l know!

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:38.530
Oh no good! I have to do it over!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:41.860
Oh! Why can't I knit straight?!

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.230
Darn it! This time I'll get it.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:49.210
l can't wait to see Okayasu's face
when l give this to him...

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.610
Oh, not again!

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.550
Oh... I'm so sleepy.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.680
I've had it.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.620
"'Nurse's Office"'

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:04.820
Misao-chan?

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.810
I'll just rest here until my next class.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.330
Misao-chan...

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:31.850
63 kilos...

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:34.850
N- no... l mustn't laugh.

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.720
Argh! All this disgusting fat!

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:44.490
Oh... Adachi-san, you're here...

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:49.120
I- I'm so sorry! I didn't mean to laugh.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:54.560
In exchange for your silence!
You are sworn to secrecy, all right?

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:57.410
What a grown-up!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:02.480
lf l were in her place, l'd have
punched anyone who made fun of me.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.150
Momo-chan! I heard you cut class!

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:08.480
No, I was just resting until my next class.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:12.490
What're you drinking, Momo-chan?
Give me a sip.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.830
Hey, hey! Quit fooling around
before others.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:19.830
I am not! I'm just being chummy!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.830
You...

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:27.170
--Ack! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
--Come back here!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.370
--Here's your punishment...
--Help me, Momo-chan!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.470
Are you still wearing that?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.950
You were jilted, and you're
still hankering for him?

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.950
Okayasu!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:49.530
Okayasu! Why'd you say
such a thing to Misao-chan?

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:55.200
What do you mean by jilted? How come
you know such a thing, Okayasu?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.870
Okayasu!

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:01.360
My brother dumped her... long ago.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:06.210
Misao-chan knew your brother, Okayasu?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:13.220
They were friends in college. And that's
how she became my tutor in middle school.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.890
Misao-chan was? I never knew that!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:18.550
Well, it's the first time I've told you.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.560
Why'd you keep it a secret?

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:26.890
No reason. Momo-chan, you were
never interested in me, s'all.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.600
See you.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:37.570
He's always like that
when it comes to his brother.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:43.600
He has a complex.
When I first met him, he was worse.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:48.580
Maybe it was a way of rebelling
against an over-achieving brother.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:52.590
He ran away a number of times,
and cut class a lot.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:58.260
And then his brother
asked me to tutor Kairi.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:02.200
What kind of person is Okayasu's brother?

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:04.200
He was wonderful.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:09.140
It made me wonder how anyone
could be born so blessed.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:15.880
There she is! Miss Misao!
Someone got hit by a ball!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.210
Be right there.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:19.370
I'll see you again, Adachi-san!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.810
l really know nothing about Okayasu.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.250
Huh? Is this Okayasu's...

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:41.640
This is Okayasu...
And the girl next to him is...

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.770
It's so faded I can't tell.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.320
Who is that?

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.870
You saw the photograph?

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.880
Okayasu, are you in love with someone?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:24.550
Perhaps... even now?

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:29.890
Don't worry about it. It was so long ago.
I was about to get rid of this.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.880
See? Satisfied?

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:02.250
Kairi?

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.980
That necklace!

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:25.830
It is you! I almost didn't recognize you!
Look how handsome you've become!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.210
Morika!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:33.050
C'mon! Don't tell me you've
forgotten your old girlfriend!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:34.740
You are as cold-hearted as ever!

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:42.560
I never asked you for a ride.

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:45.320
It's no big deal.

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:50.230
Why is Kairi sitting next to her?!

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.570
It seems cold back there...

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:56.910
You've changed. I really didn't
recognize you back there.

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:59.580
Well, I was pretty fat back then.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.600
She's the one in that photo...

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.350
What a creep!

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.860
Thank you very much.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.720
I'll get off here, too.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.870
Hey! Momo-chan!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.200
What're you doing?!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.210
Oh, calm down.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.870
I can't calm down!

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.210
Wha-?!

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:36.550
Don't be so angry.

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.550
Take me back to Momo-chan.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:44.220
Oh, how cold! After meeting like this!

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:46.620
Didn't you have something else to do?

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.560
You've really matured.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.900
If I knew, I wouldn't have
jilted you three years ago.

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.230
Hey...

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:58.100
I've missed you.

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:02.700
I came back because
I wanted to see you, Kairi.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:08.510
You used to be so kind, Kairi.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:14.850
I've been through a lot since then,
but no one's been as kind as you, Kairi.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.190
I wonder why I broke up with you.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:21.380
Then why are you still
wearing that necklace?

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.350
Didn't my brother give you that necklace?

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:29.200
Kairi...

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.530
Oh, I've got mail.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:34.200
Look at the cell phone case.
It's so shabby!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.210
I don't have money to buy a new one.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.260
"'Stupid!"'

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.070
This is not good!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.840
Huh? Hey, Kairi!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.480
Momo-chan, I'm sorry

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.250
Was that her? The one in the photo.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:16:01.500
So... that's your type, huh Okayasu?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:06.840
Aren't you lucky? She seemed to
be so happy to see you, Okayasu.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:09.170
Maybe you two can get back together.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.040
Momo-chan...

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.510
I'm sorry. That was so rude.

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.140
You're the only one for me, Momo-chan.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:26.190
Morika and I weren't that close anyway.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:29.220
It's just... our break-up
wasn't too pleasant,

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.860
so I've got a lot of baggage regarding her.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.860
Not pleasant?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.200
My brother stole her from me.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.870
But I realized today, after seeing her,

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:42.070
that it wasn't love for Morika
that I carried around with me,

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:44.540
it was my resentment towards my brother.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.540
So Momo-chan, you don't have
to worry about anything at all.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.550
Really?

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.210
Really, really.

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:53.010
Don't lie to me.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:06.190
When did l start loving Okayasu so much?

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:13.260
lt's all right. Okayasu won't hurt me.
He never has.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:20.840
l'm going to trust him.
l'm the one Okayasu's with right now.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:23.510
Wow!

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:25.510
It's almost finished!

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:27.180
When are you going to give it to him?

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:30.190
Tomorrow maybe.
It's a secret from Okayasu.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.750
It's so cute. Such a cool color.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.190
I want a cell phone case like this!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.540
Okayasu!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.210
Kairi went to the teachers' office.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.540
He's school monitor today!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:55.210
Oh! And when Adachi's in trouble!

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.010
Let's hurry!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:02.820
Is that your natural skin color?

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.490
I'm on the swim team.

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:07.160
Oh, I see.

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:13.830
How lucky! I can never get a tan.
I turn beet red.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:16.160
I guess I have really delicate skin.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:21.170
And if you get too dark, it can cause
wrinkles and splotches on your face.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:25.440
Well, they say your metabolism
slows down when you're old.

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:31.310
Humph! l'm used to dealing
with worse insults from Sae.

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:38.190
Say... you know Kairi's gourd-shaped scar
by his belly button?

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.520
I put it there.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:45.860
I thought there was an ashtray nearby.
What a riot that was.

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:48.200
A scar near his belly button?

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:54.200
No way! Don't tell me you haven't
seen it yet? Kairi's belly button?

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:57.870
Come on! How long have you two
been seeing each other?

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.540
Two months.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:07.150
That idiot! ''Not that close,'' huh?!
He slept with her!

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:14.160
What?! Two months and not yet?
That fast-worker Kairi?! I can't believe it!

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:15.490
So what?

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:18.490
If I wanted to see his belly button,
I can anytime I want!

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:22.690
We're dating, so he cherishes me!

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:26.500
Morika!

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.170
What're you doing here?!

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:31.840
I just wanted to take up where we left off
the last time... we didn't finish talking.

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:37.180
There's nothing to talk about already.
Go away and don't come back!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.850
W- what?!

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:40.640
Let's go, Momo-chan.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.200
I did it! It's all done!

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:59.200
Now, to wrap it.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.140
I can't wait to give it to him.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.500
All right!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:15.550
The number you have dialed is out
of the service area, or is not turned on.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:19.150
No way! I guess I'll call him at home.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:23.230
Yes?

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:28.900
Okayasu? I want to give you something,
so can you meet me outside?

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:32.230
Oh, you mean Kairi?

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.240
Hello, I'm Kairi's older brother.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:36.240
M- mistake!

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:41.230
I- I'm sorry! Your voice sounded
just like his... I'm sorry.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:46.580
My brother went out. I think
he's at the usual bookstore.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:49.580
I see... thank you.

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:52.310
Oh... how embarrassing!

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:57.560
But Okayasu's brother sounded very kind.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:02.560
"'Ninomiya Books"'

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.210
There he is...

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.770
All right!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.210
No way! But why?

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.890
I'm in love.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:35.900
So please... just once.
I'll be at City Hotel tomorrow.

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:37.230
What the-?!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:42.170
ls she toying with him again?!
Okayasu, tell her off!

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:46.910
All right.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.240
Really?! I'm so happy!

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.910
Oh, and Kairi...

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.920
Here, a present. Open it.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:58.590
Your case was so shabby.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:21:59.590
No thanks.

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:02.180
Come on, take it!

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:07.590
M- Momo-chan!

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:12.830
Stupid!

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:43.000
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:52.670
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:55.680
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.680 --> 00:23:02.280
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.620
Where can we go

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:18.300
where we can all be

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:20.970
under the same sky?

00:23:20.970 --> 00:23:29.310
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:35.980
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:42.320
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:49.660
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:57.630
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:04.610
Stupid Okayasu! He's such a nice brother!

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:11.950
Why? l don't want us to fight.
l can't think of anything else but Okayasu.

00:24:11.950 --> 00:24:15.220
Next on Peach Girl,
"'The Man Who Creates a Storm"'
